=2 Walkthrough
!Upper Delkfutt's Tower-map1.jpg||10th Floor
!Upper Delkfutt's Tower-map2.jpg||11th Floor
!Upper Delkfutt's Tower-map3.jpg||12th Floor
* **(Optional)** __Aldo's Decision:__ At the Tenshodo HQ in {z:Lower Jeuno}, speak to {n:Aldo} for a cutscene.
* __Zone into {z:Lower Delkfutt's Tower} from {z:Qufim Island} or via {p:Survival Guide} for a cutscene.__
* Zone into {z:Stellar Fulcrum} for a cutscene.
** {p:Home Point} # 1 in {z:Upper Delkfutt's Tower} puts you right at this zone. You can then use the teleporter.
* Having a {@i:Delkfutt Key|549} {i:Delkfutt Key|Delkfutt Key|549} or {@k} {k:Delkfutt key} will greatly speed this mission up.
* If you have a key, proceed to (E-8) on the first floor and go through the cermet door to the basement.
** Then proceed to (J-8) for another cermet door.
** In the middle of the spiral staircase at (H-8) click the ??? to be teleported to the 10th floor.
* If you do not have the key then you will have to climb the tower regularly.

* Once you reach {z:Upper Delkfutt's Tower} by any means, head for (F-8) on the first map and then through the door.
** This area is not shown on the map.
* Climb the stairs to the 11th floor. You'll need {s:Sneak} and {p:Invisible|Invisible (Status)} to avoid aggro from Bats and Giants. There are also dolls and pots which aggro magic.
* Proceed to (J-6) and go to the 12th floor.
* Head for (F-10) and go through the teleporter to enter the {z:Stellar Fulcrum}.
* Walk forward and click the __Qe'lov Gate__ to enter the battlefield.

=2 Boss Fight
* You will enter a BCNM fight against {p:Kam'lanaut}. Buffs wear when entering the BC.
** {p:Trusts} can be used.
* Clearing this BC ends the mission.

[Area
{z:Stellar Fulcrum}
>Boss
{p:Kam'lanaut}
>Abilities
* **Great Wheel:** AoE damage (~200) and Hate reset.
* **Light Blade:** Single target heavy damage (~700-1200).
** Has a charging time, and can be stunned.
** It has high range, and can be blinked by {p:Utsusemi}.

>Notes
* Will cast Silencega, {s:Dispelga} and {p:Slowga}.
* Can use an Elemental Blade attack which gives him an en-spell of that element.
** It also causes him to be healed by magic of that same element.
*** Major nukes can heal him for a lot of damage if the wrong spell is used, so be careful. It can be Dispelled.
* Immune to {s:Sleep} and {p:Silence}.
* Approximately 10,000 HP.

